{"3775890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Figureless", "steam_appid": 3775890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Figureless</strong> is a story-driven Action-Adventure Survival Horror where time is your greatest enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a desperate call pulls Colt back to the hometown he left behind, a crash at the town’s entrance traps him in something far worse than he imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The streets are not empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/88b1dd24c422ae11d449346fd88fca94.avif?t=1773521329\" width=384 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colt never planned to return home. After a sudden city-wide lockdown disrupts his new life at university, he receives a call from a hospital in his distant hometown: his uncle, the man who raised him, is dying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no one else to go, Colt sets out on an overnight drive, but he never reaches the hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A violent crash at the town’s entrance leaves him stranded and the town he remembers is no longer the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people are gone. Something else remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To uncover the truth behind the <strong>Figureless</strong>, Colt must survive long enough to reach it.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/2d9764c15cdb56704e4cfae4f6538cfe.poster.avif?t=1773521329\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/2d9764c15cdb56704e4cfae4f6538cfe.webm?t=1773521329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/f3ff989283257d9932fdfa229d1a97f9.poster.avif?t=1773521329\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/f3ff989283257d9932fdfa229d1a97f9.webm?t=1773521329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/25bfd50a6d7b4d3e53cf0110e9221a1f.poster.avif?t=1773521329\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/25bfd50a6d7b4d3e53cf0110e9221a1f.webm?t=1773521329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/2f859cab12bac966e5937043ef8f9481.avif?t=1773521329\" width=384 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Figureless</strong> blends elements of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action-Adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Horror </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metroidvania</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While being an original title, it draws inspiration from games like <strong>Zelda,</strong> <strong>Metroid </strong>and<strong> Resident Evil</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>WHAT ARE THE FIGURELESS?</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They were once human. Now they are predators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Figureless are twisted remnants of former townspeople, warped into strange humanoid entities with distinct behaviors, instincts, and hunting patterns. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll encounter over <strong>20 unique types</strong>, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seeker</strong> - Tracks movement relentlessly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stinger</strong> - Strikes with sudden, high-speed lunges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Melter</strong> - Corrosive attacks that controls space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter demands adaptation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                                   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/97de107f47adaa667fdcbd2027c5d5ba.poster.avif?t=1773521329\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/97de107f47adaa667fdcbd2027c5d5ba.webm?t=1773521329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/97de107f47adaa667fdcbd2027c5d5ba.mp4?t=1773521329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>MULTI-STAGE JOURNEY</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Figureless will feature <strong>5–7 large interconnected stages</strong>, each taking multiple hours to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your stats, gear, and progression carry over between stages. Every stage pushes you deeper into the mystery,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and closer to whatever created the Figureless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/dacdc1e5797473089e1d997f1a68aab1.poster.avif?t=1773521329\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/dacdc1e5797473089e1d997f1a68aab1.webm?t=1773521329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>A WORLD THAT RUNS ON TIME</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also features a day and night cycle where you will have a limited amount of time to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each stage lasts 20–30 in-game days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the Day:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore houses, gas stations, schools, and offices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the Figureless.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience and grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Night:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay indoors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and upgrade equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store your loot.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook meals for powerful buffs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Going outside at night is possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is also a very bad idea. <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/5dde638fbbf75743c19ec068b8858612.poster.avif?t=1773521329\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/5dde638fbbf75743c19ec068b8858612.webm?t=1773521329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/5dde638fbbf75743c19ec068b8858612.mp4?t=1773521329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>BUILD YOUR WAY</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up by defeating enemies and completing quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level grants stat points to customize your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and discover:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firearms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armor pieces </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bags and storage upgrades</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different characters scale differently, meaning builds matter. Choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/58603bc13214183fc8e01c6bdda5080c.poster.avif?t=1773521329\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/58603bc13214183fc8e01c6bdda5080c.webm?t=1773521329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/58603bc13214183fc8e01c6bdda5080c.mp4?t=1773521329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>SURVIVE TOGETHER </i></strong> <br>You won’t be alone.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new survivors as you progress. Each character features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique melee and ranged weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct scaling mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different stat synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strongly varied playstyles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight as a party of up to <strong>three active survivors</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control one directly while the others assist in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team. <br>Balance your roles. <br>Survive longer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore. Fight. Survive.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Uncover the truth behind the Figureless, before time runs out.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/6e0d8f3df8de35abbe22c24a3a047a23.avif?t=1773521329\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras_big/6e0d8f3df8de35abbe22c24a3a047a23.avif?t=1773521329 width=800 height=276 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Figureless</strong> is a story-driven Action-Adventure Survival Horror where time is your greatest enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a desperate call pulls Colt back to the hometown he left behind, a crash at the town’s entrance traps him in something far worse than he imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The streets are not empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/88b1dd24c422ae11d449346f