aragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the Day:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore houses, gas stations, schools, and offices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the Figureless.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience and grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Night:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay indoors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and upgrade equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store your loot.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook meals for powerful buffs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Going outside at night is possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is also a very bad idea. <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/5dde638fbbf75743c19ec068b8858612.poster.avif?t=1773521329\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/5dde638fbbf75743c19ec068b8858612.webm?t=1773521329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/5dde638fbbf75743c19ec068b8858612.mp4?t=1773521329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>BUILD YOUR WAY</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up by defeating enemies and completing quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level grants stat points to customize your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and discover:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firearms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armor pieces </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bags and storage upgrades</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different characters scale differently, meaning builds matter. Choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/58603bc13214183fc8e01c6bdda5080c.poster.avif?t=1773521329\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/58603bc13214183fc8e01c6bdda5080c.webm?t=1773521329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775890/extras/58603bc13214183fc8e01c6bdda5080c.mp4?t=1773521329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>SURVIVE TOGETHER </i></strong> <br>You won’t be alone.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new survivors as you progress. Each character features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique melee and ranged weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct scaling mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different stat synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strongly varied playstyles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight as a party of up to <strong>three active survivors</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control one directly while the others assist in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team. <br>Balance your roles. <br>Survive longer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore. Fight. Survive.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Uncover the truth behind the Figureless, before time runs out.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p clas